01:00:24,929 --> 01:00:27,224
You asked for the body
of Jung Chang-su, so I got it.

834
01:00:27,225 --> 01:00:29,237
Why won't you let us investigate?

835
01:00:29,496 --> 01:00:30,261
Three billion.

836
01:00:30,262 --> 01:00:31,629
Mom won't give up that money.

837
01:00:31,929 --> 01:00:34,129
She's not the type to lose and walk away.

838
01:00:34,296 --> 01:00:36,895
Why not try paying him
to keep quiet?

839
01:00:36,896 --> 01:00:38,695
What if he starts talking
after getting paid?

840
01:00:38,696 --> 01:00:41,028
- Didn't you hear anything?
- Hear what?

841
01:00:41,029 --> 01:00:43,261
I feel like I heard
someone yelling.

842
01:00:43,262 --> 01:00:44,895
We have to persuade him. If not...

843
01:00:44,896 --> 01:00:45,596
If not...

844
01:00:45,796 --> 01:00:47,189
We have to choose.

845
01:00:47,190 --> 01:00:48,490
It's family or him.

